# Intellectual Property and Composition Studies.

**Authors:** Lunsford, Andrea A., West, Susan

## Abstract
Sketches in the traditional contours of intellectual property in the digital age and its institutionalization. Surveys the forces, intellectual and technological, that are challenging that tradition. Shows how composition studies has been informed by models that do not participate in these challenges. Suggests how composition studies may move beyond its limiting models. (TB)

